**`src/lib.rs`** — added `filter_by_tag` after `ordered_pinned_first`:
```rust
pub fn filter_by_tag<'a>(notes: &'a [Note], tag: &str) -> Vec<&'a Note> {
    notes.iter().filter(|n| n.tags.iter().any(|t| t == tag)).collect()
}
```
Exact match via `==` (not substring), preserves relative order, returns borrowed `&Note`s.

**`src/main.rs`** — `list` now parses an optional `--tag <TAG>` flag from the remaining args and filters through `filter_by_tag` when present (otherwise lists all, preserving prior behavior). Missing value or unknown option exits with an error message.

